---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Home">
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>A Universal, Executable, Sonorous, and Cryptographic Language.</h1>
    <p>Built on 20 semantic primitives across 5 ontological layers (L0-L4). It compiles to Python and WebAssembly, renders deterministic SVG glyphs, synthesizes audio via the Web Audio API, and seals every state change with SHA-256 and OpenTimestamps.</p>
    
    <!-- Le badge du DOI -->
    <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem; font-weight: bold; color: #17becf; font-size: 1.1rem;">
      Officially Certified by Zenodo: <br/>
      <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23476518" target="_blank" style="color: #17becf; text-decoration: underline;">DOI 10.5281/zenodo.23476518</a>
    </p>

    <div class="buttons" style="margin-top: 2rem; display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
      <a href="/collection" class="btn" style="background: #2ca02c; color: white; padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;">Explore the 20 Live Artifacts</a>
      <a href="/demo" class="btn">Explore the Agentic Glyph</a>
      <a href="/whitepaper.html" class="btn" style="background: transparent; color: var(--text); border: 1px solid var(--text); padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;">Read the Whitepaper</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <h2>Architecture</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>L0 (Formal Logic):</strong> EXIST, SAME, ONE, ALL, NOT, IF, TRUE</li>
    <li><strong>L1 (Physical Causality):</strong> CAUSE, PART, BIG</li>
    <li><strong>L2 (Event and Action):</strong> DO, HAPPEN, MOVE</li>
    <li><strong>L3 (Cognition):</strong> KNOW, SEE, THINK, SAY</li>
    <li><strong>L4 (Life and Value):</strong> LIVE, DIE, GOOD</li>
  </ul>
</Layout>
